$css {
    .landing {
        margin: auto;
        padding-left: 1em;
        padding-right: 1em;
        max-width: 42rem;
        height: 100%;
        overflow-y: scroll;
    }

    .landing .title,
    .landing .subtitle,
    .landing .tagline,
    .landing .footer {
        display: block;
        width: fit-content;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
        overflow: visible;
    }

    .landing .title {
        margin-top: 22vh;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .landing .subtitle {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
    }

    .landing .tagline {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .landing h2 {
        margin-top: 4rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        text-decoration: underline;
        overflow: visible;
    }

    .landing .footer {
        margin-top: 6rem;
        margin-bottom: 25vh;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--main-faded);
    }
}

[class=landing]{

$[class=title]{ponder}

$[class=subtitle]{⸺ technology ⸺}

$[class=tagline]{an independent research lab}

h2{about}

ponder is an independent research lab run by a[href=https://autumn.computer]{autumn malmberg}.

h2{research}

current areas of interest include dynamical systems & chaos, machine learning, and the development of tooling that makes both easier to think about.

h2{projects}

a[href=https://tangled.org/ponder.ooo/snakepyt]{snakepyt}, a repl and custom runner environment for python sketches

a[href=https://ponder.ooo]{ponder.ooo}, a fractal gallery & collection of interactive writeups

h2{contact}

a[href=mailto:hello@ponder.technology]{hello@ponder.technology}

$[class=footer]{⸺ ⸺ ⸺}

}
